<title>SPAIN: Spain's Telepizza share price fixed at 2,300 ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's Telepizza share price fixed at 2,300 ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish pizza delivery firm Telepizza fixed the share price of its offer at 2,300 pesetas, lead manager BBV Interactivos said late on Sunday.</p>
<p>Retail investors will be able to buy shares at a discount of three percent or 2,231 pesetas per share.</p>
<p>The subscription period closed on Friday and the definitive share allocation will be known on Monday. Telepizza is expected to start trading on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
